    "text": "1 days ago THATCHER — Children in Graham and Greenlee counties will be returning school over the next few weeks, and a pair of organizations want to help families get ready. The Greenlee County Community Closet Back-to-School Event will take place Thursday, July 9, from 5-7 p.m., at the Shepherd of the Hills Community Church in Morenci. Read full article",
